          "id": "a3aef06a-f84c-4390-ac03-977814c1e404",
          "memory": "On Monday, October 5, 2026, User got home late after being stuck at work until about 5:40pm, ending a streak of leaving on time, while Maya and Leo commiserated that Monday felt long for no reason.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "1cc4098f-fcd1-4544-9a9a-c8141313f203",
          "memory": "On October 5, 2026, Maya said her laptop froze twice that day and IT was still ghosted after two sacred restarts didn't help, Leo said his laptop was dragging all afternoon, and User said three restarts last week didn't help.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "af5c6187-867b-4f9d-8b2a-1a6c39fbfa22",
          "memory": "On the morning of Monday, October 5, 2026, Maya did leg day and said her legs already hurt and stairs hurt, while User joked about stairs hurting tomorrow and Leo joked to never go back to leg day.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "10549eac-421d-4dd9-ac85-1d2326dcfe00",
          "memory": "On the evening of October 5, 2026, Maya planned soup and toast for dinner, Leo had already eaten honey nut cereal an hour earlier, and User planned leftover pasta, describing being in a pasta loop.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "29feac29-98e2-4ef8-b433-6e9e77e1570e",
          "memory": "User, Maya, and Leo agreed on October 5, 2026 to have pizza lunch at noon on Friday, October 9, 2026 at Luigi's on 5th Street, with User walking from work, Maya bussing over, Leo driving, and meeting out front.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "75eaba60-3c51-4358-8eaf-bdc673613b28",
          "memory": "On October 5, 2026, the Friday crew decided not to return to Mario's for pizza because the olives were way too salty last time, though User loved the crust and Leo liked it otherwise, wanting garlic knots energy at a different spot.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "56ade42c-9db4-44ab-9f09-1b3144e83725",
          "memory": "On October 5, 2026, Leo said his kitchen sink ecosystem was a mess again only about four days after clearing it, with User noting he cleared it and Maya asking if it already rebooted, joking it was a new record.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "d8614c31-67bd-45ed-bef3-80d67fa85fb8",
          "memory": "On the evening of October 5, 2026, Leo invited Maya and User to play the chaotic co-op cooking game later that night, with Maya saying maybe one round depending on leg soreness and User agreeing to join for one, under Maya's house rule of two fires max.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "b2ae6486-bdd2-4b9d-ba28-3a43191a2094",
          "memory": "User, Maya, and Leo put on a sketch featuring the crying suit guy and catchphrases 'never go back to leg day' and 'never go back to workkkk' with dramatic trailer voice while doing their endless dishes cycle, as discussed October 5, 2026.",
          "event": "ADD"
        },
        {
          "id": "5bb321b0-087e-42a5-949d-418e8a864ce9",
          "memory": "On the night of October 5, 2026, Maya had tea because she was freezing, with Leo requesting the weird lemon tea virtually and User requesting chamomile, which Maya remembered for them.",
          "event": "ADD"
        }
      ]
